      "source_section": "Statement",
      "quote": "Let $F$ be an ordered field ([[def-ordered-field]]) with positive cone $P$, and let $a, b \\in F$. 1. If $a > 0$ then $a^{-1} > 0$. 2. If $0 < a < b$ then $0 < b^{-1} < a^{-1}$.",
