items/ex-componentwise-convergence-and-a-vector-valued-integral-computed.md-74-[L5] Monotonicity and linearity of the integral ([[thm-monotonicity-of-the-integral]], [[thm-linearity-of-the-integral]], [[lem-finite-sum-laws]], [[def-finite-sum]]).
